title Cassette: a tap on split flag 1 selects it (white outline), the SPLIT key becomes REMOVE and removes it; Right moves the marker; ZOOM steps; Esc goes back to the list
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_DEMO_TRIM unselected
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "SPLIT"
expect notext "REMOVE"
shot trim-unselected
@480x320 tapxy 0.148 0.455
@640x480 tapxy 0.148 0.41
@320x480 tapxy 0.1755 0.417
wait 300
expect text "REMOVE"
@320x480 expect text "SPLIT 1 SELECTED"
say the tap on flag 1 selected it (trim_select_split) and SPLIT reads REMOVE
shot trim-flag1
tap "REMOVE"
wait 300
expect text "SPLIT"
expect notext "REMOVE"
@480x320,640x480 expect text "IN 02:58.7 · OUT 10:28.7 · LEN 07:30.0 · 1 split"
say REMOVE deleted the split (trim_remove_split)
key right
wait 200
@480x320,640x480 expect text "05:21.2"
@320x480 expect text "5:21.2"
say Right moved the marker 0.1 s (trim_nudge 100)
@480x320 tapxy 0.4583 0.6865
@640x480 tapxy 0.4583 0.71
@320x480 tapxy 0.4075 0.684
wait 300
expect text "30 s"
say ZOOM + narrowed the window (trim_zoom)
shot trim-zoomed
key esc
wait 300
expect text "RENAME"
say Esc went back to the list
expect noquit
